flowchart LR
    Bernoulli["[H] Bernoulli(p)<br/>E[X] = p<br/>Var(X) = p(1-p)"]
    Binomial["[H] Binomial(n,p)<br/>E[X] = np<br/>Var(X) = np(1-p)"]
    NegBinomial["[M] Negative Binomial(r,p)<br/>X = trials until r successes<br/>E[X] = r/p<br/>Var(X) = r(1-p)/p²"]
    Geometric["[M] Geometric(p)<br/>X = trials until first success<br/>E[X] = 1/p<br/>Var(X) = (1-p)/p²"]
    Multinomial["[M] Multinomial(n,p₁…pₖ)<br/>E[Xᵢ] = npᵢ<br/>Var(Xᵢ) = npᵢ(1-pᵢ)<br/>Cov(Xᵢ,Xⱼ) = -npᵢpⱼ"]
    Hypergeometric["[M] Hypergeometric(N,K,n)<br/>E[X] = nK/N<br/>Var(X) = n(K/N)(1-K/N)(N-n)/(N-1)"]
    DiscreteUniform["[L] Discrete Uniform(a,b)<br/>E[X] = (a+b)/2<br/>Var(X) = ((b-a+1)²-1)/12"]
    Poisson["[H] Poisson(λ)<br/>E[X] = λ<br/>Var(X) = λ"]
    Normal["[H] Normal(μ,σ²)<br/>E[X] = μ<br/>Var(X) = σ²"]
    Lognormal["[L] Lognormal(μ,σ²)<br/>log X ~ Normal(μ,σ²)<br/>E[X] = exp(μ+σ²/2)<br/>Var(X) = (exp(σ²)-1)exp(2μ+σ²)"]
    Exponential["[M] Exponential(λ)<br/>E[X] = 1/λ<br/>Var(X) = 1/λ²"]
    Gamma["[L] Gamma(k,θ)<br/>E[X] = kθ<br/>Var(X) = kθ²"]
    Beta["[L] Beta(α,β)<br/>E[X] = α/(α+β)<br/>Var(X) = αβ/((α+β)²(α+β+1))"]
    Uniform["[H] Uniform(a,b)<br/>E[X] = (a+b)/2<br/>Var(X) = (b-a)²/12"]
    ChiSquare["[H] Chi-square(ν)<br/>E[X] = ν<br/>Var(X) = 2ν"]
    F["[H] F(d₁,d₂)<br/>E[X] = d₂/(d₂-2), d₂&gt;2<br/>Var(X) = 2d₂²(d₁+d₂-2)/(d₁(d₂-2)²(d₂-4))"]
    T["[H] Student t(ν)<br/>E[X] = 0, ν&gt;1<br/>Var(X) = ν/(ν-2), ν&gt;2"]

    Bernoulli -->|"sum of n independent trials"| Binomial
    Bernoulli -->|"trials until r-th success"| NegBinomial
    NegBinomial -->|"r = 1"| Geometric

    Binomial -->|"generalize 2 categories to k"| Multinomial
    Binomial -.->|"without-replacement analogue"| Hypergeometric
    Binomial -->|"rare-event limit"| Poisson
    Binomial -->|"large-n normal approximation"| Normal

    Geometric -->|"scaled continuous-time limit"| Exponential
    Poisson -->|"interarrival time in same Poisson process"| Exponential
    Exponential -->|"sum of k independent waiting times"| Gamma

    Gamma -->|"X/(X+Y), independent Gammas with same scale"| Beta
    Beta -->|"α = β = 1"| Uniform
    DiscreteUniform -->|"rescaled increasingly fine grid"| Uniform

    Normal -->|"exponentiate"| Lognormal
    Normal -->|"sum of ν squared standard Normals"| ChiSquare
    Gamma -->|"k = ν/2, θ = 2"| ChiSquare

    ChiSquare -->|"ratio of two independent scaled Chi-squares"| F
    Normal -->|"supplies numerator Z"| T
    ChiSquare -->|"supplies denominator √(U/ν)"| T

